          "date": "2026-11-13 12:51:24.000000000",
          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit coverage for pool spill logic",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit coverage for pool spill logic\n\nAdd kunit coverage for lod_spill_target_refresh() and\nlod_check_and_spill_pool(), the QoS-driven pool spill logic that\nredirects allocation away from an over-full pool to its configured\nspill target. Export both from lod_pool.c so lod_pool_test.ko can\nlink against them.\n\nTests cover: spill check skipped while pool_spill_expire is still in\nthe future, skipped when spill is disabled (threshold_pct == 0),\nis_active left false below the threshold and set true at/above it,\nand lod_check_and_spill_pool() redirecting a pool name to its spill\ntarget and incrementing pool_spill_hit, including the no-name case.\nlod_qos_statfs_update() is made a no-op via obd_osfs_age so the tests\nexercise lod_spill_target_refresh()'s own math over the mock targets'\ncached ltd_statfs data.\n\nAlso add the new functions to lod/KUNIT.list so lustre/kunit/ku's\nfile-selection picks up lod_pool_test on changes to them, and add the\nlod_pool_add()/lod_pool_remove() entries missed by an earlier commit.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [Augment Code]\nChange-Id: Ia2b354835bc78676eefaf99dfbbbea56e96f0dba\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
